    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adventure of Emberclaw</strong> is an exhilarating action-adventure 3D platformer that promises both challenge and fun. Join Emberclaw, a lovable little dragon, as he battles enemies, navigates treacherous levels, and collects dynamite on his quest to defend his world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the guidance of his mother dragon, Emberclaw must defend their home from a looming alien invasion and ultimately confront Eggalor the alien king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout his breathtaking journey, Emberclaw will encounter a variety of foes and uncover vital clues. From the depths of the earth to the heights of the clouds, through treacherous mines and vast oceans, and even across a volcanic castle to the stars, he bravely embarks on a mystical adventure that tests his courage and determination.</p>",
